infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Same phone, 12 fps vs 60 fps
  desc The pointermove handler decides the frame budget, not the hardware
  compares
    - label height + layout reads (12 fps)
      children
        - label Animate height per pointermove
          desc Each write invalidates layout
        - label Read offsetHeight right after
          desc Forced sync layout, 5-8 ms each
        - label ~2 events per 60 Hz frame
          desc 10-16 ms of layout per frame
        - label Budget blown before paint
          desc 12 fps on a mid-range SoC
    - label transform + rAF batch (60 fps)
      children
        - label Translate the sheet with transform
          desc Compositor-only, no layout
        - label Measure once on pointerdown
          desc Zero layout reads in move
        - label One rAF write per frame
          desc Microseconds, not 10-16 ms
        - label touch-action none on the handle
          desc Browser stops arbitrating scroll
theme
  palette #f43f5e #10b981
